  "notes": "COMPOUNDS:\n{高|たか}い (high, loud) + {笑|わら}い (laugh)\n\nUSAGE:\nOften associated with:\n- Villains in fiction (villainous laughter)\n- Triumphant or confident people\n- Uninhibited, carefree expressions of joy\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {高笑|たかわら}いする - to laugh loudly\n- {高笑|たかわら}いを{響|ひび}かせる - to let out a loud laugh\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {大笑|おおわら}い - hearty laugh\n- {爆笑|ばくしょう} - burst of laughter\n- {哄笑|こうしょう} - roar of laughter (literary)",
